      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Emoji can be disabled through your Shield Level, using the \"Custom Images\" option. Instance owners and moderators can now also toggle emoji off in the Here tab.\n\nAdditionally, you can always report a user for inappropriate emoji, and images.\n\nI still think Accessibility emoji are very important, and those should not be globally disabled.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
