  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-04-02T21:19:53.213Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It used to only happen every so often, but now, in every other lobby, there are people who spam emojis/prints/stickers of gore or inappropriate content. When it comes to gore, it's the same few images, and when it comes to NSFW content, it's a lot. Adding moderation or a way to report emoji's while they are happening would be a neat feature, but I usually just report it as a behavior issue.",
